<urn:atm:triage:finding/AL6-WINCI-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AL6-WINCI-001" ;
  triage:title "Windows-only test uses pre-AL6-CR-001 4-arg HttpRuntimeConfig::new signature" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-http-runtime/src/lib.rs:1597, test unix_socket_configuration_is_rejected_on_non_unix_targets (#[cfg(not(unix))]) still calls HttpRuntimeConfig::new(SocketAddr::new(...), Some(UnixSocketConfig::new(...)), limits, timeouts) -- the pre-AL6-CR-001 4-arg signature. AL6-CR-001 changed the first parameter to LoopbackTcpConfig, but this Windows-only test wasn't updated, breaking both Just lint (windows-latest) and Test (windows-latest) on PR #777 at 6a1ab335. Root-caused via gh run view as a single E0308 type mismatch; cascading clippy errors are a compile-cascade from the same failure, not independent bugs. New finding, self-discovered by quality-mgr during AL6-QA-1 reconciliation (not pre-existing on develop)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-al" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
